  "name": "destroylist",
  "description": "\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tPhishDestroy Blocklist Dataset\n\t\n\nReal-time feed of phishing, crypto drainer, and scam domains detected by PhishDestroy.\nUpdated hourly from GitHub.\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tStatistics\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nMetric\nCount\n\n\n\t\t\nTotal Domains\n190,415\n\n\nDNS Active\n118,173\n\n\nContent Active\n76,116\n\n\nDead Domains\n72,109\n\n\nCommunity Blocklist\n1,050,357\n\n\nAdded Today\n4\n\n\nAdded This Week\n4\n\n\n\t\n\nLast updated: 2026-08-17 20:30 UTC\n\n\t\n\t\t\n\t\n\t\n\t\tFiles\n\t\n\n\n\t\n\t\t\nFile\nDescription\n\n\n\t\t\nlist.json\nFull domain list (JSON array)\u2026 See the full description on the dataset page: https://huggingface.co/datasets/phishdestroy/destroylist.",
